    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n** VIRTUAL TOUR AVAILABLE BY REQUEST **\n\nMySherryFitz Online Portal -> To view current offers or place your own offer on this property, please visit SherryFitz.ie and register for your mySherryFitz account.\n\nSherry FitzGerald Gleeson are delighted to present No. 7 Ashgrove, Monadreen, Thurles to the market, comprising an attractive 2-Bed semi-detached bungalow, situated in this established and sought-after residential location close to Thurles Town Centre.\n\nThe property offers bright, well laid out accommodation, including two En-Suite Bedrooms, together with gardens to the front and rear and a generous driveway providing off-street parking.\n\nLOCATION\n\nAshgrove is situated in the Monadreen area on the southern side of Thurles, with No. 7 occupying a cul-de-sac position close to the development's communal green area.\n\nThe property enjoys a convenient location close to local shops, schools, services and amenities, including Thurles Shopping Centre / Dunnes Stores and Lidl, with Liberty Square and the wider Town Centre also readily accessible.\n\nFor commuters, the M8 Dublin / Cork Motorway is conveniently accessible via Horse & Jockey, while Thurles Railway Station is also within easy reach.\n\nACCOMMODATION\n\nAccommodation comprises Entrance Hall, open-plan Sitting Room / Dining Area, Kitchen, Utility, 2 no. Bedrooms, both with En-Suite Shower Rooms, together with a separate Bathroom and Hotpress / Store.\n\nThe Sitting Room benefits from a bay window to the front, feature fireplace and rooflight, with sliding patio doors opening directly onto the rear garden. A wide opening connects to the adjoining Dining Area, creating a bright and comfortable living space.\n\nThe Kitchen contains fitted wall and floor units with tiled splashbacks, while the separate Utility provides additional storage and an external door to the rear. Both Bedrooms benefit from their own En-Suite facilities, with the rear Bedroom also featuring a bay window overlooking the garden.\n\nTotal Floor Area: Approx. 805 Sq.Ft. / 74.8 Sq.M.\n\nOUTSIDE\n\nTo the front, there is a generous driveway providing off-street parking, together with a lawned garden enclosed by boundary walls and brick pillars.\n\nPedestrian side access leads to the enclosed rear garden, laid mainly in lawn and offering space for outdoor seating, recreation and gardening. Sliding patio doors from the Sitting Room provide a direct connection between the living accommodation and garden.\n\nOverall, No. 7 Ashgrove presents an ideal opportunity to acquire a conveniently located bungalow with two En-Suite Bedrooms, bright living accommodation and gardens to the front and rear. The property will appeal to a wide variety of new owners including First Time Buyer(s), those relocating / downsizing from Country to Town, Investors etc.\n\nVIRTUAL TOUR / VIEWINGS\n\nA virtual tour link can be provided by Sherry FitzGerald Gleeson upon request. In-person viewings are strictly by appointment.\n\n______________________________\n\nThese particulars are issued by Sherry FitzGerald Gleeson on the strict understanding that they do not form part of any contract and are provided for guidance purposes only. While every effort has been made to ensure accuracy, no liability is accepted for any errors or omissions. All areas stated are for guidance purposes only and interested parties should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of same through inspection or other means. Any boundaries shown are approximate and for identification purposes only. The vendor does not make or give, and neither Sherry FitzGerald Gleeson nor any of its employees has authority to make or give, any representation or warranty in respect of this property. Sherry FitzGerald Gleeson is marketing this property on the basis that all relevant title and certification documents are in place or will be provided by the vendor prior to sale.\n\n______________________________"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.59m x 1.00m\nWith tiled flooring and access to attic.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.47m x 3.46m\nSpacious Bedroom with laminate timber flooring, En-Suite and Bay Window.\n\nEn-Suite - 1.65m x 1.65m\nWith W.C, W.H.B, electric shower and tiled flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.95m x 3.73m\nBright Bedroom with laminate timber flooring and En-Suite.\n\nEn-Suite - 1.65m x 1.66m\nWith W.C, W.H.B, electric shower and tiled flooring.\n\nBathroom - 3.40m x 1.99m\nWith W.C, W.H.B, bath and tiled flooring.\n\nHot Press / Store - 1.01m x 0.99m\nWith tiled flooring.\n\nDining Area - 2.86m x 2.88m\nBright Dining Area with laminate timber flooring and open plan to Sitting Room.\n\nKitchen - 1.87m x 2.92m\nWith modern fitted Kitchen and tiled flooring.\n\nUtility Room - 1.96m x 1.31m\nWith fitted storage, plumbed for washing machine / dryer, tiled flooring and rear access to garden.\n\nSitting Room - 5.36m x 3.28m\nLarge Sitting Room with open fire place, Bay Window, sliding doors to Garden, laminate timber flooring and skylight.\n\n"
